 "notes": "Meant for the bundle arm only (operator request 2026-10-17, default off; the bundle file is edited by its own thread, not here). Incumbent: the finals incumbent with low-hp-trainer-warning-v1 ON, since this switch needs it; the candidate flips heal-before-trainers-v1 alone. Earliest activation is ROUTE_102, the first route with trainers after the rival. Measured on 14 recorded runs of 2026-10-16/17 by raw-RAM replay (worklog 2026-10-17_heal-before-trainers): 32 warnings in 7 runs, 12 of 42 trainer battles started weak and every one was warned first; 11 of those 12 were won anyway, 1 was lost (e046, LASS HALEY). A checkpoint start on ROUTE102 or ROUTE104 with a weak lead would test it far more cheaply. Not designed (pokebench-experiment-design) and not queued: design it before it is queued or driven as a cohort. Provisional source.commit is the branch head before merge; repin with `just experiment-pin` when it lands."
